---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/ui/SectionHeading.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Service | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description="Client agreement, booking retainers, copyright ownership, and service terms at Khemzy Studios."
>
  <header class="legal-hero section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="TERMS & CONDITIONS"
        title="Terms of Service"
        description="Last updated: October 2026. Standard policies governing photography retainers, licensing, copyright, and delivery."
      />
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="section legal-content-section">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <h2>1. Reservation & Payment Terms</h2>
      <p>
        A 50% non-refundable retainer and an executed client agreement are required to secure your date.
        Dates are not held based on oral communications. The remaining 50% balance must be settled 7 days
        prior to wedding/event dates or on the day of studio sessions.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Rescheduling & Cancellations</h2>
      <p>
        In the event of client rescheduling due to documented emergencies or force majeure, the retainer
        may be transferred to a mutually agreeable available date within 6 months. Cancellations initiated
        without rescheduling forfeit the retainer to cover reserved calendar availability and pre-production planning.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Copyright & Usage Rights</h2>
      <p>
        In accordance with Nigerian and international copyright statutes, Khemzy Studios retains the moral
        and legal copyright to all photographs captured.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Personal & Family Commissions:</strong> Clients receive a perpetual, non-exclusive personal
          print and display license allowing unlimited reproduction for private, non-commercial purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Commercial & Brand Commissions:</strong> Commercial licensing terms (territories, duration,
          and media channels) are defined specifically in the commission schedule agreement.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Artistic Discretion & Post-Production</h2>
      <p>
        Clients acknowledge that Khemzy Studios is commissioned for our distinct editorial perspective and
        lighting signature. Curation, color grading, and retouching selections remain within our professional
        artistic discretion. RAW unedited digital files are not released under any circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        In the highly improbable circumstance that equipment malfunction, severe illness, or unforeseen catastrophe
        prevents coverage, our liability is strictly limited to the full refund of all monies paid by the client.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-content-section {
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
